<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates in low 3.00-4.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates in low 3.00-4.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excess liquidity continued to keep overnight rates on the Jordanian dinar on Thursday in a low 3.00-4.00 pct range, dealers said.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
